# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONE RULE: if it is in github-excluded/, it does not go to GitHub.
#
# Everything below that folder is development material - the specifications
# and working notes, the hi-res art masters, the untreated audio sources, and
# the scripts that turn masters into the files the game actually serves.
#
# Anything you do NOT want published - for any reason, including privacy and
# third-party material - goes in that folder and needs no new rule here. The
# rest of this repository IS what is published, with nothing hidden between
# the lines.
#
# The masters are backed up to the NAS; this folder is the working copy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
github-excluded/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ordinary housekeeping below - secrets, tooling droppings, OS clutter.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
APIKEY/
**/APIKEY/
*.pem
*.key

# Dependencies and generated output
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log

# Python tooling
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Editor and operating-system files
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*~
